<td id="S5.T2.2.23.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb"></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.23.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="S5.T2.2.23.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:270.3pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.23.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T2.2.23.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Feedback granularity and utility</span>: scores, constraint violations, trace-level logs; which kinds of feedback resolve which failure patterns</span>
</span></td></tr>
